    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo are delighted to present this superb semi-detached house to the market. Recently redecorated, the property is in excellent condition throughout and offers great scope for extension. Ideally located in this sought-after estate, the property will appeal to first-time buyers and families looking to trade up to a larger home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, bright living room with bay window, open plan kitchen/dining room, and utility closet. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, and a modern family bathroom. The rear garden is laid out in patio and lawn and enjoys a sunny south-east orientation. At the front there is a driveway and lawn. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nThe Gallops is hugely popular development in South Dublin thanks to its family-friendly community in close proximity to great transport links, schools, and shops. The property itself is located just 200m from The Gallops Luas stop while Holy Trinity National School is also just a short walk away. Dunnes Stores, in addition to a number of restaurants, cafés and bars, at Leopardstown Shopping Centre are a 7 minute walk away while The Park Carrickmines is a short drive south and Dundrum Town Centre a short drive north. The Gallops also boasts a large green & playground, and there are a number of excellent sporting and leisure clubs in the vicinity. In addition to the Luas, the 47 bus route operates nearby while the M50 can be accessed within minutes.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
